# The enforcement surface. Replace @OWNER with a real human owner and enable
# "Require review from Code Owners" on the protected branch; that host
# setting is what makes AGENTS.md's "loosening requires human countersign"
# mechanical instead of advisory. Cargo.toml is unanchored on purpose: member
# crate manifests carry the `[lints] workspace = true` opt-in, so adding one
# is a wall edit too. If the mise task fragment (20-rust.toml) lives outside
# /.config/mise/, add its path here.
/.cargo/ @OWNER
/.config/mise/ @OWNER
/.github/ @OWNER
/AGENTS.md @OWNER
Cargo.toml @OWNER
/clippy.toml @OWNER
/deny.toml @OWNER
/rustfmt.toml @OWNER
